The main-checkout patch in gate-repo-switch.diff does not apply to
/mnt/e/hackios/k60-lead, because that tree's scripts/check-docs.py already
self-locates:

    REPO = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))   # k60-lead/scripts/check-docs.py:24

so only scripts/research-gate.py still hardcodes the shared checkout and still
swallows its problem list. Verified 2026-11-14:

    cd /mnt/e/hackios/k60-lead && git apply --check gate-repo-switch.diff
      -> error: patch failed: scripts/check-docs.py:21  (does not apply)

This file carries the two hunks that do apply there. Behaviour is unchanged when
K60_REPO is unset, so applying it changes no existing gate result.

